WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.860
- My mom is my best friend, Linda,

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.710
and she's completely selfless.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:06.260
She volunteers thousands
of hours in her community,

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:10.660
and she was diagnosed with
terminal breast cancer

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:13.020
and given two years and
that was four years ago.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.363
So, she's still with us.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.780
She's raised us kids, and I promised her

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:20.300
that when she beats it we're
gonna take her to see Reba,

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:21.850
and that is a goal of ours.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.930
But she's really sick,

00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:24.870
so having you sing it
is the next best thing

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.330
because we absolutely love you.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:27.680
So thank you so much.

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:31.440
- Did you say she was given
two years and its been four?

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.273
- [Blonde Woman] Yes

00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:33.430
- She's one hell of a fighter.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.130
- Yes, she absolutely is.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.150
- That's a beautiful thing,

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:37.474
four years and they gave her two.

00:00:37.474 --> 00:00:38.970
She got this.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:41.524
- We had a couple close
calls but she's been good.

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:43.024
- Come on up here.

00:00:43.888 --> 00:00:45.093
Come on up here.

00:00:45.093 --> 00:00:47.455
(applause)

00:00:47.455 --> 00:00:49.597
- Thank you so much.

00:00:49.597 --> 00:00:51.255
I love that, thank you.

00:00:51.255 --> 00:00:55.630
- I was expecting a fun thing
and that's not a fun thing.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.885
I'm so sorry.

00:00:56.885 --> 00:00:57.718
- She's fine, she's fine.

00:00:57.718 --> 00:01:01.340
- I know she's fine, but
that's a heavy thing.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.990
Well tell me little bit
more about your mom though.

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:05.010
Why is she such a big Reba fan?

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:07.120
- She's always raised us on country music,

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.870
and growing up in the car, at home

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:12.600
she's always played Reba for us.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:14.530
So we've just always
grown up with the music,

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:18.420
and she's huge on country
so I'm huge on country

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.573
Huge on Kelly.

00:01:19.573 --> 00:01:20.600
- Yeah

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:22.320
- Yeah, you singing it
was really big for her.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.967
- Okay, well I love your mom.

00:01:23.967 --> 00:01:24.870
- She's awesome.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:25.800
- So what's your mom like?

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.010
Is she fun like you?

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.040
- Oh, she's tons of fun.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:28.873
I could tell you stories,

00:01:28.873 --> 00:01:30.650
but it's probably not
appropriate for here.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:33.293
But we've gone to Vegas
- Oh my gosh, I love her.

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.130
- for her 50th,

00:01:34.130 --> 00:01:36.740
and we have get togethers at the house

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.430
and she host all the
holidays and all the parties,

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.384
and she's amazing.

00:01:39.384 --> 00:01:40.217
- Oh, she' a light.

00:01:40.217 --> 00:01:41.050
- She's so much fun.

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:41.883
Even though she's sick,

00:01:41.883 --> 00:01:45.600
she makes sure that she's
the life of the party

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.600
as best as she can be

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:49.440
and she still does
everything for everybody else

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.450
even though she's going through
what she's going through.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:52.930
Everybody else comes first.

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:54.743
- That's a beautiful mom.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.770
All right, well I am honored you said

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.000
I'm the next best thing to Reba,

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.800
but I think your mom deserves the best

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.443
so please welcome country
legend, Reba McEntire.

